* EQUATIONS "Control_and_Gains"
*
EQUATIONS 4
HEAT_ON = LT([8,1], 23) ! Heating mode enable signal: ON when delayed zone temperature is below 23°C. HEAT_ON [-]; from [8,1] Output Value [any]; to -> [6,3] On / Off signal [-]
COOL_ON = GE([8,1], 24) ! Cooling mode enable signal: ON when delayed zone temperature is at or above 24°C, creating a 1°C deadband (23-24°C) with heating to prevent simultaneous operation. COOL_ON [-]; from [8,1] Output Value [any]; to -> [7,3] On / Off signal [-]
SOLAR_GAIN = [2,18] * 10 ! Simplified solar heat gain through windows, calculated as total horizontal radiation multiplied by factor 10. SOLAR_GAIN [kJ/hr]; from [2,18] Total horizontal radiation [kJ/hr.m²]; to -> [3,7] Rate of energy gain from lights [kJ/hr]
TOTAL_EQ_GAIN = [6,1] + [7,1] ! Total equipment heat gain to building: sum of heating PID output (positive) and cooling PID output (negative). TOTAL_EQ_GAIN [kJ/hr]; from [6,1] Control signal [kJ/hr]; from [7,1] Control signal [kJ/hr]; to -> [3,8] Rate of energy from equipment [kJ/hr]; to -> [9,2] Right axis variable [kJ/hr]
*$UNIT_NAME Control_and_Gains
*$LAYER Main
*$POSITION 620 147
*$UNIT_NUMBER 11
*------------------------------------------------------------------------------

END
